      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your downed spaceship and find your way home. Explore a lush and colourful world littered with riddles and sprinkled with memorable characters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <strong>Pan-Pan</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pan-Pan is an adventure game with environmental narrative storytelling, exploration elements and puzzle solving. Enter a vibrant, colourful and quirky world where you unlock new areas by collecting items and solving riddles. Pan-Pan is created by SPELKRAFT in collaboration with Might &amp; Delight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an open world: Unlock new areas by collecting items and solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar soundtrack with soothing ambient sounds created by acclaimed sound producer Simon Viklund.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A balanced blend of exploration and puzzle solving game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story beats told through environmental interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a mix of tools, gadgets and devices to solve puzzles and uncover the path home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your downed spaceship and find your way home. Explore a lush and colourful world littered with riddles and sprinkled with memorable characters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <strong>Pan-Pan</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pan-Pan is an adventure game with environmental narrative storytelling, exploration elements and puzzle solving. Enter a vibrant, colourful and quirky world where you unlock new areas by collecting items and solving riddles. Pan-Pan is created by SPELKRAFT in collaboration with Might &amp; Delight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an open world: Unlock new areas by collecting items and solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar soundtrack with soothing ambient sounds created by acclaimed sound producer Simon Viklund.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A balanced blend of exploration and puzzle solving game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story beats told through environmental interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a mix of tools, gadgets and devices to solve puzzles and uncover the path home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
